        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "There have to be 4 Citizens [i]revealed from the deck and put into play[/i]. Since Citizen Dawn is put into play first as part of her setup, she is not revealed from her deck. Four other Citizens need to come from the deck.  :) \n\nAside from Citizen Dare, I believe, who is an edge case and doesn't count in setup.",
