        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-19T22:03:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There will be 3 citizens and her at the start of the game.</p>\n<p>The boring technical explanation is that while she does count as a citizen for all of her other effects, her start of game effect says “draw from the deck until 3 are revealed”, Citizen Dawn is already in play and cannot be ‘revealed’ at this point.</p>\n<p>EDIT: Ninja’ed! But it’s 3 and Dawn, not 4 and Dawn (unless that is one of the things that changed in the Second Ed.).</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:07:36.386Z",
